<title>BELGIUM: EU cereals experts to agree pet food refund.</title>
<headline>EU cereals experts to agree pet food refund.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union cereals experts on Thursday will agree a refund for pet food importers who paid full duty on shipments from Hungary into Austria, an EU official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The technical amendment to a reduced tariff agreement with Hungary will be voted through on the nod.</p>
<p>&quot;It will allow Austrian importers to reclaim excess duty paid due to delays in implementing the necessary legislation,&quot; the official said.</p>
</text>
